WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:50.970
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.810
<i>Only to defeat this man...</i>

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.410
Three Swords Style Technique!

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.320
Better not regret it when I kill you!

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.820
Three Thousand Worlds!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:23.700
<i>Zoro!!</i>

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:31.410
<i>"The Deadly Foot Technique Bursts Forth!
Sanji vs. the Invincible Pearl."</i>

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:48.030
All right!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:51.000
They want to fight, too!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:51.630
Umph!

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.370
I'm getting fired up!

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.700
Pops! You promised, okay?

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.710
Once I drive them away,
I'll quit doing chores. Okay?

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.280
Couldn't ask for more.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:06.110
If you do chores for a year,
this place will get messed up.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.650
All right!

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:12.320
You said you were going to be
King of the Pirates. Are you serious?

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:17.320
Yeah, of course! I'll definitely
be King of the Pirates!

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:19.990
I've come across tons of roughnecks.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:23.800
But you're the first one in
a long time who said that so clearly.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.800
I heard that you were
an incredibly strong pirate.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:31.010
Were you going to be
King of the Pirates?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.010
I forgot about the past.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:40.210
I'm the owner of a restaurant
now and that's enough for me.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:45.550
Guys! As long as we take that ship,

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.860
the Grand Line is
nothing to be scared of!

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:54.400
We can get closer and make a surprise
attack on enemy ships more effectively

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:59.170
than pretending to be a Navy ship
or raising the white flag of surrender.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:02.240
We can make a definite sneak attack.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.470
It's true that no one would think...

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:08.310
that pirates are on board
such a silly-looking ship.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:13.280
B-but, Don... Even if we enter
the Grand Line again using that ship,

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:17.840
if we come across someone
like Hawk-Eye Mihawk again...

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:26.330
Are you still afraid of
someone like that? Huh?!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.660
N-no...

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:33.000
You think an ordinary human can
slice up a large sailing ship?!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:36.500
That's probably the power
of a devil fruit.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.510
Although those with devil fruit powers
are considered by society to be legends,

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.350
the Grand Line is crawling with them.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:49.680
Mihawk must've used some strange
power when he sliced up the ship.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:56.850
Even that straw hat brat is a mere pirate
once he enters the Grand Line.

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:09.630
But Red Foot Zeff traveled
there for a year.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:18.980
I can't but think that he had ways
of confronting those monsters.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:24.650
And those methods must be
written in his logbook.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:28.120
If we're lucky, so is information
on the One Piece.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.660
I see... That's our Don Krieg!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.890
So long as we have
that ship and the logbook,

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.830
we'll find a way to the One Piece again!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:40.130
Got that, guys?! Let's go!
We'll take over the restaurant!

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:42.670
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:45.510
This ship belongs to us... to the cooks!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:49.010
We can't let them have it...
no matter what happens!

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.850
N-now... what do we do
to operate this again?

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.610
Hurry up!

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:01.880
As it stands, the restaurant
will be a battlefield...

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:19.640
I wish there was a restaurant
in the middle of the sea...

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.980
I was thinking that if
I could leave this place alive,

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.980
I'd build a restaurant as
my final purpose in life...

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.420
A restaurant as my final
purpose in life...

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:35.320
Go to the operating room
and open up the fins.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:38.530
What? Open up the fins?

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:41.160
That's gonna give
a foothold to the enemy!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:47.000
That's fine. We can't make the inside
of this restaurant a battlefield.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.670
If it becomes a battlefield,
that damn geezer will complain.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.970
Did you say something,
you damn brat?

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.680
Yeah, I said you like
to complain! Now, go.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.700
O... Okay...

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:03.120
Here they come!
They're finally coming!

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.290
Here I come! Gum-Gum...

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.960
Rocket!

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.290
Ugh! He's flying over here!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.530
And Gum-Gum...

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.330
Giant Scythe!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.190
Oof!

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.280
Hey, that chore boy is pretty good!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.280
--J-just what the heck...
--is he...

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:35.850
The Grand Line is crawling
with guys like this?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.820
--Sanji!
--Hmm?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:41.320
Watch carefully how he fights.

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:46.660
Don't take your eyes off him until
the moment this fight comes to an end.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.660
Hmm?

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:52.000
To think that you attack the restaurant
after they gave you food...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.960
I'll beat up an ungrateful jerk like you!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.010
So you actually want to fight on
the water when there's little foothold?

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:06.610
Those with devil fruit powers are
helpless in the sea. I know that much.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:10.570
--Anchor boy!
--Instead, I can stretch.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:16.690
Sanji! The fins are gonna open up now!

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.900
--Hmm?
--What's going on?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.650
From the sea...

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.670
a foothold has appeared!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:58.220
Whoa! Check that out!!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:05.270
We'll fight to the utmost,
you damn pirates!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:10.280
I see. You set up that battlefield so that
the restaurant itself won't be damaged.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:14.180
That works out for us too,
since that ship's gonna be ours.

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:18.620
I want this ship all the more.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.420
We won't let you have this restaurant!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.960
That's right! Don't make light of us!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.890
We're fighting cooks!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:38.310
Take sail! The Baratie's sea
battle weapon, Mackerel Head 1!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.800
If you don't wanna die,
get out of here now!

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.310
What the hell is that?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.650
That's so cool! I want it!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.980
--Paddle faster!
--I'm paddling as fast as I can!

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.320
Fire!!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.090
I'm gonna sink!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:09.230
--All right! Good job!
--Patty! Carne! Get them!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.430
They're pretty good!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.010
Don't look away! We're aiming at him!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.480
Yeah!

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.680
Krieg! Be prepared!!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:28.780
Watch how powerful the Sea Restaurant
Baratie's sea battle weapon is!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.200
What? Did we bump into something?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.600
Hmm? We can't move!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:46.710
I'm Don Krieg!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:49.380
I'm the man who will rule
the world's oceans!

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.380
I told you that's gonna be me!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:56.080
I don't have time for your games!

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:03.360
What Herculean strength he has!

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.330
It's coming this way!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:16.390
The restaurant will be destroyed!

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:36.790
--Sanji!
--W-with his foot?!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:05.150
Wh-what strong legs!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.490
He kicked back that weird boat!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:10.320
That foot technique is...

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.330
There goes! Sanji's kick!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.450
He's pretty good!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.330
You son of a bitch, Sanji!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.500
Are you trying to crush your allies?

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.510
--Yeah...
--Don't "yeah" us, you crazy stew!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:30.340
You almost lost powerful assets,
you stupid spaghetti!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:36.680
Do you really think you have
time to crack jokes, cooks?

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.710
Let's get them!

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.700
Even with a weapon, a cook's a cook.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:13:00.170
We're expert fighters who're in
a whole other league from you.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.650
Now, be good little cooks and go
find a land restaurant to cook for.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:08.320
Hey, you guys! Why are you letting
those guys beat you up so easily?!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.650
Do you still call
yourselves fighting cooks?!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.750
Well, they're strong!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.660
They're totally different
from those we've fought before!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:19.130
Don't lump us in with
those average pirates.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:23.460
We're the Krieg Pirates,
the rulers of the East Blue.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:29.670
Just decree to them... that the ship
already belongs to the Krieg Pirates!

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:32.170
Don't be mistaken.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.680
We won't let you take even
one step into the restaurant.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:38.540
He's exactly right!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.690
I've been a cook for
more than ten years.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.820
I visited 300 restaurants.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:50.360
I got fired for causing a scuffle all
the time and I lived a rough life.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.130
This is the place we finally came to

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.590
after going to restaurant
after restaurant...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.360
Anybody there?!

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:00.700
Is this the restaurant
run by Red Foot Zeff?!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.640
This "Damn Cooks Wanted"
better be true!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.100
Yeah, it's true.

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:16.650
Be they arch rogues or jail breakers,

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:21.320
if they badly want to eat and find
their way to this restaurant,

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:27.660
we'll feed them until they're stuffed.
Can you handle that?!

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:29.600
Y-yes sir!

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:38.340
We can't serve such a nasty
soup to the customers!

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:40.170
What did you hit me for?!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.010
That's a sign for determination!

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:43.440
Shut up!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:47.010
Scuffles... cooking...
We're allowed to do whatever we like.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.020
There's no other restaurant
as good as this.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:53.690
So they say. Got that, Krieg?

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:57.690
Committing ourselves to cooking
every day is a fierce battle.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:02.600
Compared to that, the pirates
we're facing today are nothing!

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:03.800
He's exactly right!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.300
--Fight!
--Yeah!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.860
--Protect Owner!!
--Protect the restaurant!!

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:22.580
Th-that's...

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.990
Hmm...

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.090
Just what're you guys doing?

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.530
What's with that guy?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.000
Unassailable! Hence invincible!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.240
<i>When someone says "Pearl-san,
the Invincible Shield</i>

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.010
of the Krieg Pirates,"
they mean me!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.680
<i>Pearl-san!</i>

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.340
Patty! Carne! Are you all right?!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:59.010
They're not all right, because they
took my killer punch "Pearl Surprise."

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:04.420
Whoa! This is a nice knife. I'll take it.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:10.920
Hmm? Hey, let go. Give it to me!
Let it go, you damn loser!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:25.550
He's really got some good kicks!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:28.180
I didn't come to like him for nothing!

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.820
A kitchen knife is a cook's soul.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.790
Don't you amateurs
carelessly put hands on it!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:36.520
Sanji...

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:39.630
Hold this tight and stay down there.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.000
I'll take care of them.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.760
We won't be beaten by a mere cook!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:58.350
A mere cook, you said? I'm gonna
cut you in three, you bastards!

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:02.420
Ha! How impudent you are
to beat them using only kicks.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.620
Is that your policy?

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:09.760
To cooks, hands are most important.
I can't have them hurt in battle.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:12.290
I'll take you down
with this leg as well.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:15.130
Take me down? That's impossible.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:20.630
I'm an invincible man that won
all 61 of my battles unharmed.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:27.640
I've never shed blood in a battle,
not even a drop.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:30.610
Winning unharmed is
the very proof of my power.

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:37.650
I'm a shield man and a gentleman.
I'm refined, aren't I?

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:40.650
Was that supposed to a gag?
It wasn't funny at all.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.390
Hey, straw hat brat!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.980
If you're not paying attention,
you'll get hurt!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.000
Even battleship cannons
don't work on me.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.660
I come out of any attack unharmed!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:03.870
Boy, that startled me.
Good thing I didn't fall in the sea.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.450
What?

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.880
Ahh... This isn't good.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:11.950
Blood! Oh no!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.090
<i>Pearl-san, don't worry.</i>

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:17.960
--It's just a nosebleed!
--It's not a wound from fighting!

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:21.290
<i>--Please calm down, Pearl-san!
--What's going on?</i>

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:24.630
Th-th-th-these guys are dangerous!

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.970
What's with him? He's acting strange.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.560
What about his nosebleed?

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:38.080
Stop it, Pearl! It's just a nosebleed!
Don't lose your cool!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.950
What the heck is he about to do?

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:48.220
Danger! Danger! Danger!!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.990
Oh no! It's started!

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.000
<i>When Pearl-san gets upset,
he catches fire!</i>

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.000
What was that?

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:05.610
Fire Pearls... Special Treat!!

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.270
Ouch!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:10.640
<i>Pearl-san! Please stop!</i>

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:15.980
Burn! With this flame
and the flame shield,

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.780
you have no idea how invincible I am!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:24.360
That idiot! Is he going to burn down
the ship that we're gonna take over?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:27.450
--Ow, ow, ow, ow...
--Dammit!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:32.300
Crap! There's no escape from a sea
of flames in the middle of the sea!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.300
This isn't good!
The restaurant will catch fire!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.570
This restaurant will burn?

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:40.110
--Burn! Burn!
--You son of a bitch!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:43.640
You idiot! You'll get burned, Sanji!

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:48.480
I'm not just gonna let you...
burn this restaurant down!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.890
H-he's so reckless!

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:56.190
Does he want to turn
into a human torch?!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.720
When even fierce animals would
stay away from Fire Pearls!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:05.000
You fool! I'd be unfit for a cook
if I was afraid of flames!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:10.670
D-dammit! What a refined guy he is!

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.660
Here I come!

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.280
Ahh! That hit him good!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.540
<i>He broke through
Invincible Pearl-san's wall!</i>

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:28.350
What's with this cook?
He's really crazy.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:33.260
Y-y-you son of a bitch!
Fire! I need more fire!

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:37.030
I need to feed more Fire Pearls!

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:39.030
Ahh! The restaurant will catch fire!

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:42.700
If the fire gets into the kitchen,
the restaurant will be blown away!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:46.900
Owner! Please get out of there! Owner!!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.850
--Whoa!!
--Whoa!!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:01.020
M-my Fire Pearls...

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:03.660
Something like that is child's play!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:06.330
The gust from his kick
put out the flame!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:08.630
What the hell?! That's
definitely a divine technique!

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:11.660
So Red Foot Zeff is still strong?!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:15.030
Pops is really cool! I'm impressed!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:25.350
Now that it's come to this,
I'll sink you all with the fins

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.800
before the restaurant catches fire!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.350
Sanji! Watch out!!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.980
Oh no! He's surrounded by fire!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.700
--Ow, ow, ow...
--Chore boy!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.430
Gum-Gum... Bazooka!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:52.600
--Ow, ow, ow...
--He hit that iron ball back!

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:10.820
<i>Pearl-san is really down this time!</i>

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:12.890
<i>--Pearl-san is...
--Pearl-san is...</i>

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.490
What the heck?

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:16.660
That guy sure is dumb.

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:18.530
Geez... They're all...

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:21.870
In the end, I can only count on myself...

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:30.000
The battle ends here.

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:40.350
That's right! Shoot Red Foot Zeff!

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:44.790
All we need to do is kill him.
Then the restaurant will be ours!

00:22:56.040 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:37.000
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:52.560
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:24:02.560
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
